    - target: {fileID: 8563684494448067901, guid: 0a3b6392f04558844bd340e68ced1ff9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: 'Note to the investigator:


        Ensure the participant is comfortably
        seated on the chair with the headset and hand controller.  Also make sure
        the wires are not taut and they are able to rotate or swivel freely in the
        chair.


        Enter the same participant ID if this is a subsequent session
        for the same participant.'
